5. PRIVACY

   The Software opens and saves score files on your computer. The Software
   itself does not connect to the internet and does not collect personal data.
   Third-party plug-ins that you choose to load (see section 6) run inside the
   Software and are governed by their makers' own privacy policies; some may
   connect to the internet for their own purposes, such as license activation.
   When the score-sync option is on, the Software passes the open score to the
   plug-in you selected so that it can play the score.

